# Master Architecture & Execution Plan: Babylon.js 2.5D Tuxemon & RuneScape MMO

**Vision:** A browser-based MMORPG combining the open-world skill progression of RuneScape with the creature collection and sprite combat of Tuxemon (Pokémon-style), rendered using a **Babylon.js 2.5D billboard sprite engine** with a fully decoupled **Integrated Dev Editor & Configuration Suite**.

